# Marek vault — keep the raw conversation local, commit only curated notes.
# See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-16-marek-discord-vault-design.md

# Raw DiscordChatExporter output + everything generated from it
_raw/
archive/
attachments/

# Obsidian volatile state (keep app.json tracked, ignore the rest)
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
